[00:04.40]Fame < Infamy
[00:04.40]声望<臭名
[00:23.20]I'm a preacher sweating in the pews
[00:23.20]我是在教堂长椅上大汗不止的传教士
[00:28.78]For the salvation I'm bringing you
[00:28.78]将要带给你我无法把握的救赎
[00:34.56]I'm a salesman, I'm selling you hooks and plans
[00:34.56]我是个售货员 想卖给你艳遇和计划
[00:40.46]And myself making demands
[00:40.46]以及我自己的需求
[00:44.97]When I'm home alone I just dance by myself
[00:44.97]当我一个人回到家时我会和自己跳舞
[00:50.60]And you pull my head so close volume goes with the truth
[00:50.60]你将我拉入怀中 音量像真相那样发出巨响
[00:56.17]Signing off "I'm alright in bed but I'm better with a pen"
